# Ignore unnecessary files during Docker build
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/*.pyo
**/*.pyd
**/.Python
**/env
**/venv
**/ENV
**/env.bak
**/venv.bak

# Node modules and build artifacts
**/node_modules
**/npm-debug.log*
**/yarn-debug.log*
**/yarn-error.log*

# IDE files
**/.vscode
**/.idea
**/*.swp
**/*.swo

# OS files
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db

# Git files
**/.git
**/.gitignore

# Documentation (not needed in container)
**/README.md
**/MIGRATION.md

# Deployment helpers (not needed in container)
**/deploy.ps1
**/docker-compose.yml

# Temporary files
**/tmp
**/temp
**/*.log
